WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.153
Hello, everyone! I'm Mr. Jake. Welcome to Online A two, Book two.

2
00:00:05.453 --> 00:00:08.886
Hi! I'm Sreypich. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:09.186 --> 00:00:14.973
Unit eight: Social Media. In this unit, you will talk about using social media well.

4
00:00:15.983 --> 00:00:17.182
Social media.

5
00:00:17.882 --> 00:00:22.169
Social media means websites and apps where people share and talk.

6
00:00:22.469 --> 00:00:24.956
My sister uses social media a lot.

7
00:00:25.656 --> 00:00:28.471
Your turn. Say: Social media.

8
00:00:31.171 --> 00:00:32.427
Social media.

9
00:00:33.417 --> 00:00:34.151
Post.

10
00:00:34.851 --> 00:00:37.466
Post means to put a message or photo online.

11
00:00:37.766 --> 00:00:39.579
I post photos of my garden.

12
00:00:40.279 --> 00:00:42.514
Your turn. Say: Post.

13
00:00:45.214 --> 00:00:46.157
Post.

14
00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:47.861
Like.

15
00:00:48.561 --> 00:00:51.002
Like means a click to show you enjoy a post.

16
00:00:51.302 --> 00:00:53.139
My photo got fifty likes.

17
00:00:53.839 --> 00:00:56.746
Your turn. Say: Like.

18
00:00:59.446 --> 00:01:00.146
Like.

19
00:01:01.150 --> 00:01:01.919
Comment.

20
00:01:02.619 --> 00:01:05.025
Comment means words you write under a post.

21
00:01:05.325 --> 00:01:06.930
She wrote a kind comment.

22
00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:10.027
Your turn. Say: Comment.

23
00:01:12.727 --> 00:01:13.588
Comment.

24
00:01:14.583 --> 00:01:15.201
Follow.

25
00:01:15.901 --> 00:01:18.551
Follow means to choose to see someone's posts.

26
00:01:18.851 --> 00:01:20.514
I follow a science channel.

27
00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:23.820
Your turn. Say: Follow.

28
00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:27.254
Follow.

29
00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:28.972
Photo.

30
00:01:29.672 --> 00:01:31.881
Photo means a picture taken with a camera.

31
00:01:32.181 --> 00:01:34.250
Ask before you post someone's photo.

32
00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:36.871
Your turn. Say: Photo.

33
00:01:39.571 --> 00:01:40.282
Photo.

34
00:01:41.283 --> 00:01:41.971
Kind.

35
00:01:42.671 --> 00:01:44.403
Kind means nice and caring.

36
00:01:44.703 --> 00:01:46.494
Always be kind online.

37
00:01:47.194 --> 00:01:50.067
Your turn. Say: Kind.

38
00:01:52.767 --> 00:01:53.455
Kind.

39
00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:55.184
Time.

40
00:01:55.884 --> 00:01:57.640
Time means minutes and hours.

41
00:01:57.940 --> 00:01:59.939
Don't spend too much time online.

42
00:02:00.639 --> 00:02:03.280
Your turn. Say: Time.

43
00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:06.656
Time.

44
00:02:07.650 --> 00:02:09.580
Now let's listen to a conversation.

45
00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:11.984
Sreypich, do you use social media?

46
00:02:13.283 --> 00:02:16.107
Yes, I usually post photos of my drawings.

47
00:02:17.417 --> 00:02:18.685
Do you write comments?

48
00:02:19.983 --> 00:02:23.135
Sometimes. I always write kind comments.

49
00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:26.450
How much time do you spend online?

50
00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:30.121
I never spend more than one hour a day.

51
00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:34.531
Grammar focus: Adverbs of frequency.

52
00:02:34.831 --> 00:02:38.226
I usually post photos. I never write unkind comments.

53
00:02:38.526 --> 00:02:44.336
Put adverbs of frequency before the main verb but after 'be': I usually post. I'm always kind.

54
00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:48.502
Now read and listen. Smart on Social Media.

55
00:02:48.802 --> 00:02:52.380
Many people use social media to post photos and follow friends.

56
00:02:53.683 --> 00:02:56.066
I usually post pictures of my drawings.

57
00:02:57.350 --> 00:03:02.345
I always write a kind comment, and I never share other people's photos without asking.

58
00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.591
I think about who can see my post.

59
00:03:06.883 --> 00:03:10.973
I don't spend too much time online, so I have time for family and sport.

60
00:03:12.283 --> 00:03:14.831
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

61
00:03:15.131 --> 00:03:18.294
I blank write unkind comments. (0%)

62
00:03:18.594 --> 00:03:21.958
A, never. B, always. C, usually.

63
00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:27.590
The answer is A: never.

64
00:03:29.083 --> 00:03:31.454
Words you write under a post are a blank.

65
00:03:31.754 --> 00:03:34.665
A, comment. B, like. C, photo.

66
00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:40.684
The answer is A: comment.

67
00:03:42.183 --> 00:03:44.787
To choose to see someone's posts is to blank.

68
00:03:45.087 --> 00:03:47.985
A, follow. B, block. C, post.

69
00:03:51.983 --> 00:03:53.786
The answer is A: follow.

70
00:03:55.283 --> 00:03:59.178
Now it's your turn to speak. What are good and bad things about social media?

71
00:04:04.478 --> 00:04:11.658
A good thing is that I can share my art. A bad thing is that people sometimes write unkind comments, so I always think before I post.

72
00:04:11.958 --> 00:04:13.737
Excellent answer, Sreypich!

73
00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:18.854
Great work today! You learned eight new words and adverbs of frequency.

74
00:04:19.154 --> 00:04:22.259
Today's value is kindness. Be kind to everyone.

75
00:04:22.559 --> 00:04:25.072
See you in Unit nine. Goodbye!

76
00:04:25.372 --> 00:04:27.722
Thank you, Mr. Jake! Bye, everyone!

